      "text": "startObserver();",
      "fontSize": 8.096065872592586,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "startObserver();",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "vF_XZEqORjcSWzZ8dwgQz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3204.107538566538,
      "y": -2321.0645331945384,
      "width": 282.47733406983707,
      "height": 10.233846809396516,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1210711486,
      "version": 651,
      "versionNonce": 1183724763,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "Uk41iKdAsR9nrMu1z-iWi",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1790892993082,
      "created": 1790865655619,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Creates a single MutationObserver object for the current session. ",
      "fontSize": 8.187077447517213,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Creates a single MutationObserver object for the current session. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "SEUWWX1PBHMcK642cbr1P",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3203.1946180904924,
      "y": -2299.636367886318,
      "width": 367.83060750467024,
      "height": 29.855265269095987,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1200799138,
      "version": 512,
      "versionNonce": 709937659,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790892258038,
      "created": 1790865731516,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The observer watches Gmail's whole <body> (subtree: true) for attribute changes, but the\nattributeFilter: [\"aria-checked\"] narrows it so the callback only fires when an element's aria-checked\nattribute changes — everything else is ignored.",
      "fontSize": 7.96140407175893,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The observer watches Gmail's whole <body> (subtree: true) for attribute changes, but the attributeFilter: [\"aria-checked\"] narrows it so the callback only fires when an element's aria-checked attribute changes — everything else is ignored.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "yKYGXy6cuIBONvB3QZyz4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3204.3169317597567,
      "y": -2259.443891617451,
      "width": 384.93513730764226,
      "height": 19.580225444906105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1799931902,
      "version": 517,
      "versionNonce": 1127994011,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790892258038,
      "created": 1790865805200,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The observer itself is not checkbox-aware — it just reports any aria-checked mutation anywhere in <body>.\nIn practice, that attribute belongs to Gmail's row checkbox ([role=\"checkbox\"]).",
      "fontSize": 7.83209017796244,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The observer itself is not checkbox-aware — it just reports any aria-checked mutation anywhere in <body>. In practice, that attribute belongs to Gmail's row checkbox ([role=\"checkbox\"]).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Y4anfFjI-WLqeshrqh-t9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3204.498753611931,
      "y": -2229.926024583484,
      "width": 427.9384787507494,
      "height": 19.381000176757436,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2097668386,
      "version": 431,
      "versionNonce": 263331872,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791070844927,
      "created": 1790865879997,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "When such a change occurs, the observer fires the callback with the list of mutations; the callback then uses\nm.target.closest(\"tr.zA\") to find the enclosing Gmail row and calls queueRow(row) to batch it for processing.",
      "fontSize": 7.752400070702975,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "When such a change occurs, the observer fires the callback with the list of mutations; the callback then uses m.target.closest(\"tr.zA\") to find the enclosing Gmail row and calls queueRow(row) to batch it for processing.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
