      "text": "1.Find the Gmail account index (u) and use data-legacy-thread-id to\nbuild the Gmail print‑view URL.",
      "fontSize": 4.317028607162987,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.Find the Gmail account index (u) and use data-legacy-thread-id to build the Gmail print‑view URL.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "XQ7v16-G_CB3e2lOXTrh4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 151.81331450749798,
      "y": -2342.8913564590034,
