      "created": 1790937763923,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. From doc select all the anchor (<a>) elements whose href\nattribute contains the substring view=att.",
      "fontSize": 4.085800886880793,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. From doc select all the anchor (<a>) elements whose href attribute contains the substring view=att.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "tcDLSaMewGPcGwNO0SMvJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 151.25021329948495,
      "y": -2222.5785802023515,
      "width": 125.02313878052757,
      "height": 25.391116604580265,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1649816731,
      "version": 1070,
      "versionNonce": 1861749442,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790976875931,
      "created": 1790938151095,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. For each element, retrieve the value of the href attribute. If it's\nempty, skip it. Decode any HTML entities (e.g., &amp; → &) in the\nraw href.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 4.062578656732843,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. For each element, retrieve the value of the href attribute. If it's empty, skip it. Decode any HTML entities (e.g., &amp; → &) in the raw href.\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "TibhjZkqNTPyqg7EXSYmY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 151.5558072984717,
