      "text": "This array is used for storing the data of\nthe PDFs that have been skipped. In this\nmap, it is assumed that for errors pertaining\nto PDFs, or wherever a PDF is skipped, the\nfiles go into the skipped array. Hence, the\nflow regarding skipped PDFs is assumed and\nis not explicitly shown anywhere in this map.",
